"donor_log2fc":-0.0820676,"donor_lfcse":0.108646,"donor_log2fc_shrunk":4.4658e-06}],"modules":[{"cell_type":"Ex","gene_id":"ENSG00000100335","module":"turquoise","kme":0.181501,"hub":false,"module_direction":"lower in AD","module_padj":0.572565,"module_significant":false},{"cell_type":"In","gene_id":"ENSG00000100335","module":"turquoise","kme":0.179499,"hub":false,"module_direction":"lower in AD","module_padj":0.446504,"module_significant":false}],"degas_bulk_de":false,"drug_target":false}},"description":[{"gene_id":"ENSG00000100335","entrez_id":["54471"],"uniprot":["Q9NQG6"],"ncbi_summary":"Enables ADP binding activity; GDP binding activity; and identical protein binding activity. Involved in several processes, including positive regulation of mitochondrial fission; positive regulation of mitochondrial translation; and positive regulation of protein targeting to membrane. Located in mitochondrial matrix and mitochondrial outer membrane. Colocalizes with mitochondrial large ribosomal subunit. [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Apr 2022]","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q9NQG6","text":"Mitochondrial outer membrane protein which regulates mitochondrial fission/fusion dynamics (PubMed:21701560, PubMed:23921378, PubMed:33632269). Promotes the recruitment and association of the fission mediator dynamin-related protein 1 (DNM1L) to the mitochondrial surface independently of the mitochondrial fission FIS1 and MFF proteins. Regulates DNM1L GTPase activity and DNM1L oligomerization. Binds ADP and can also bind GDP, although with lower affinity. Does not bind CDP, UDP, ATP, AMP or GTP. Inhibits DNM1L GTPase activity in the absence of bound ADP. Requires ADP to stimulate DNM1L GTPase activity and the assembly of DNM1L into long, oligomeric tubules with a spiral pattern, as opposed to the ring-like DNM1L oligomers observed in the absence of bound ADP. Does not require ADP for its function in recruiting DNM1L."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}